messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/addtiffo/tif_ovrcache.c
Line: 49
Function: TIFFCreateOvrCache
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: _TIFFmalloc(sizeof(TIFFOvrCache)) may return NULL on allocation failure, but psCache is dereferenced immediately (psCache->nDirOffset, psCache->hTIFF) without a NULL check, leading to a crash on out-of-memory.

Source context:
```c
